请对以下 case 进行三维加权评分。

=== case_id ===
Case-07-sports-event-001

=== 用户原始指令 (query.txt) ===
搞个实时变数字的卡片点进去能看到红色警告

=== TaskSpec 契约 (task.taskSpec.json) ===
{
  "userQuery": "搞个实时变数字的卡片点进去能看到红色警告",
  "size": "2x2",
  "eventCandidates": [
    {
      "call": "clickToDeeplink",
      "args": {
        "bundleName": "",
        "abilityName": "",
        "uri": "hwmusic://com.huawei.hmsapp.music/showMusicList?code=a001&type=4"
      }
    }
  ],
  "dataModelSchema": {
    "event": {
      "title": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "赛事提醒卡片的赛事名称或对象",
        "sampleValue": "冲刺赛"
      },
      "liveNumber": {
        "type": "number",
        "description": "实时变化的赛事数字，用于主视觉展示",
        "sampleValue": 87
      },
      "numberUnit": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "实时数字的展示单位",
        "sampleValue": "分"
      },
      "liveLabel": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "实时数字的短标签",
        "sampleValue": "实时"
      },
      "alertText": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "点击入口对应的红色警告文案",
        "sampleValue": "红色警告"
      }
    }
  },
  "assetCandidates": [
    {
      "src": "resources/base/media/figure_run.svg",
      "description": "跑步人物黑色图标，适合赛事、运动记录和实时比赛提醒的识别图标。"
    }
  ]
}

=== 待评审 DSL (card.dsl.jsonl，共 3 行) ===
